# The first binaries in this repository, and the file that says so.
#
# `apps/website/src/lib/seo/fonts/` holds two JetBrains Mono faces under the
# OFL, vendored because satori — which `next/og` renders through — accepts
# neither a system face nor WOFF2, and `next/font` emits only WOFF2. The site
# already loads the same family for the page; these are for the images.
#
# Git's own heuristic would classify them correctly. Saying it here is for the
# reader: a repository that held no binary now holds two, on purpose, and the
# line below is where that fact is written down rather than inferred.
*.ttf binary
*.ico binary
